 style having a  better grip on it than ever before most  importantly she would master the final  form of the flower breathing style  equinoctial vermilion eye which is a  technique that significantly increases  the kinetic vision of the user and  allowing the user to have incredible  perception however the final form is  quite dangerous and can cause blindness  in the user on the other hand a skilled  demon slayer like kanao would  considerably reduce the damage taken by  mastering the technique what's more  kanawa was also trained by shinobu the  insect hashida therefore she might  possess some of her medicinal  capabilities as well and would take over  the butterfly mansion in short hanau  would be showcasing a beautiful mixture  of the abilities taught to her by the  kocho sisters while effectively  delivering a unique color of her own to  the position of the flower hashira up  next we have a remarkably unique demon  slayer genya shinazugawa what's so  different about him our boy genya had an  unimaginable tragic past and belonged to  a family of nine one day a demon killed  off the shinazugawa siblings and badly  scarred genya sanami the win hashida and  the older brother of genya tried to  protect him while he escaped and tried  to look for a doctor upon coming back  and witnessing sanami kill off their  mother who was the demon behind the  killings of their siblings genya  misunderstood the situation and thought  that his brother was a murderer and  assumed that his siblings were killed  off by a wolf instead the terrible event  caused the shinazugawa brothers to have  a broken relationship throughout the  anime although genya realized his  mistake and tried to get closer to his  brother by becoming a demon slayer  sanami never acknowledged him making him  realize just how weak he was compared to  others however genya continued to work  hard to become a hashida and get closer  to his older brother so how powerful  would genya be as the future hashida  despite not being able to use a  breathing technique like his fellow  demon slayers genya managed to not only  survive but kick butt with the help of  the repetitive action technique taught  to him by giome himejima the guy trained  under the strongest hashida of the  current generation so he's bound to be  incredibly tough even though without  possessing a breathing technique  furthermore genya can temporarily obtain  unique demonic powers depending on the  demon he consumes do you know what that  means as a hashida genya would master  this technique and would practically be  invincible especially if he consumes any  part of muzan kibutsuji the future  hashira would be an exceptional user of  the blood demon art similar to that of  nezuko's and would create several  techniques of his own as genya can  create bullets from his flesh he could  learn to create many different weapons  and objects to tackle demons effectively  additionally kenya is an expert marksman  and a master swordsman making him an  exceptional and brilliant hashida of the  next generation dania has set an example  of his own by possessing unique  abilities and honing them to the point  that he could easily attack an upper  moon without even being a breath user  now that's something even the strongest  demon slayers would struggle with let's  talk about the boar-headed boy nosuke  hashibira on the surface inosuke seems  to be quite reckless and carefree but  that's far from the truth growing up  inosuke has suffered from quite a few  scars himself explaining his eccentric  behavior throughout the series inosuke's  mother escaped from his abusive father  and was taken in by the upper moon rank  2 demons cult upon realizing the reality  of the situation she was in inosuke's  mother ran away and tried to protect her  son by throwing him in the river  desperately hoping he would survive  unfortunately in the end she was unable  to save herself and was devoured by doma  later inosuke was adopted by boars and  