ra  jigoro then also took it upon himself to  train zenitsu as a swordsman the  thunder-breathing user suffers from  self-esteem issues throughout the anime  and doesn't believe that he's capable of  killing anything but a bug however he  managed to slay some of the strongest  demons out there and what's even more  interesting he did all of that while  being unconscious so let's talk about  zenitsu as the future hashida how would  he be and would he overcome his  weaknesses despite being a coward with  multiple self-esteem issues zenitu is an  extraordinarily powerful thunderbreeding  user and a master swordsman much like  the other characters he would add a  different flavor of his own to the  position of the thunder hashira offering  a unique set of skills and abilities he  would grow up to be the most mature and  influential person which may seem  impossible at the moment but he will  eventually become more confident  competent and mature although zenitu's  main specialty is that he has perfectly  mastered one form of the thunder  breathing style as a hashida he would  learn the remaining forms as well this  is because zenith's nerves and  self-esteem issues prevent him from  unleashing his full power as he slowly  grows and becomes more confident he will  have no trouble learning the remaining  forms of thunder breathing and wouldn't  need to fall asleep to fight any demon  what's more with how talented zenitu is  he would develop various techniques  linked to his heightened senses and  incredible speed and reflexes overall he  would make a killer thunder hashira and  his growth would surely bring joy to all  the fans finally we have our main  character heart of the fandom tanjiro  kamado tanjido had an unimaginable tough  time throughout the series being the  eldest child he's endured a lot of  hardships for his family he was quite  young when his father died but he took  it upon himself to protect his family  and became the sole breadwinner for them  tangido l